  "$comment": "PLACEHOLDER sample data. NAMES, ROLES and PHOTOS are exactly as in the Figma Find a Doctor list (14 cards) + the Home doctor row. COUNTRY, HOSPITAL, SPECIALTY ids and Ahmad's bio/sub-specialities are NOT assigned in Figma except Ahmad's profile text: country/hospital are invented test values so the filters can be exercised. Replace the whole file with Pramod's export. Schema: id, slug, old_url (current site URL, feeds the 301 map), name{en,ar}, title{en,ar}, specialties[] (ids in specialties.json), hospital_id (hospitals.json slug), country ae|sa, languages[], bio{en,ar} (HTML), sub_specialities[{en,ar}], photo (image key under src/assets), photo_alt{en,ar} (falls back to the name). DESIGN-ONLY extras for the sample: card_photo {size|h, dx} tunes the photo box inside the Figma card (Figma sizes each photo by hand; real data omits it and gets the default), home_photo (the Home row uses different crops), home_title, show_book_now (Figma shows a second 'Book Now' button on the first card only), listed=false hides a doctor from the list (Halawani is on Home only).",
